sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(e.g. Prometheus)<br/>HTTPS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+ FIPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant Upstream as Upstream Service<br/>8081/TCP HTTP<br/>localhost

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 1: Authenticated Proxy Request

    Client->>Proxy: HTTPS Request (8443/TCP)<br/>Auth: Bearer Token / Client Cert / OIDC JWT<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+

    Note over Proxy: TLS Termination<br/>Path Allow/Ignore Filter

    alt Bearer Token Authentication
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (6443/TCP)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: TokenReview Result<br/>(user info, groups)
    else Client Certificate Authentication
        Note over Proxy: Extract CommonName<br/>from client cert
    else OIDC JWT Authentication
        Note over Proxy: Validate JWT against<br/>OIDC issuer
    end

    Note over Proxy: Authorization Chain

    alt Hardcoded Authorizer
        Note over Proxy: Auto-allow<br/>openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s<br/>GET /metrics
    else Static Authorizer
        Note over Proxy: Check static rules
    else SAR Authorizer
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview (6443/TCP)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token<br/>Resource: configured attributes
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: SAR Result (allowed/denied)
    end

    Note over Proxy: Inject Headers<br/>x-remote-user<br/>x-remote-groups

    Proxy->>Upstream: HTTP Request (8081/TCP)<br/>localhost, no encryption<br/>Headers: x-remote-user, x-remote-groups
    Upstream-->>Proxy: HTTP Response
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTPS Response (8443/TCP)<br/>Encryption: TLS 1.2+

    Note over Proxy: OCSF 1.9.0 Audit Log<br/>(non-blocking, bounded queue)

    Note over Client,Upstream: Flow 2: Health Check

    Client->>Proxy: GET /healthz (proxy-endpoints port)<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.2+, No Auth
    Proxy-->>Client: 200 OK
